Frequency: Per contract cycle (annual/biennial typically)
Volume: ~50–100 major software/cloud contracts
Owner: Software Asset Manager
Participants: Software Asset Mgr, Procurement, Legal, Finance
Source: workflow W3245 — Vendor True-Up, Renewal &amp; Contract Management</bpmn:documentation>
