        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-143 (ensure IT asset &amp; license entitlement integrity.) | - operational: continuous compliance (W3241/W3242); operational: legal scoping and contract audit-clause limits
Owner: Software Asset Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
