    <bpmn:process id="W_W3247" name="W3247. Open Source License Compliance &amp; Security" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New build/release (links to VS-27.1 W132); policy review; vulnerability alert
Frequency: Continuous + per release
Volume: Open-source components in custom apps, ERP integrations
Owner: Software Asset Manager
Participants: Software Asset Mgr, Development (links to VS-27.1), Security (links to VS-27.3), Legal
Source: workflow W3247 — Open Source License Compliance &amp; Security</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3247_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3247_Lane1" name="Software Asset Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3247_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
