      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3247_Start5" name="New build/release (links to VS-27.1 W132); policy review; vulnerability alert">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3247_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3247_Task6" name="Software Asset Mgr/Dev (links to VS-27.1 W132) maintain software bill of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Software Asset Mgr/Dev (links to VS-27.1 W132) maintain software bill of materials (SBOM) for custom applications and integrations: scan code for open-source components and their licenses (permissive, copyleft/GPL, weak-copyleft); inventory versions and direct/transitive dependencies
Responsible (R): Software Asset Mgr / Dev
Accountable (A): Software Asset Manager
Duration: Per release</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3247_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3247_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3247_Task7" name="Legal/Dev review license obligations: copyleft (GPL/AGPL) obligations (source…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Dev review license obligations: copyleft (GPL/AGPL) obligations (source disclosure, derivative-work licensing) may conflict with proprietary distribution — avoid or isolate; attribution/notices for permissive (MIT/Apache/BSD); ensure compliance with each license&#x27;s terms
Responsible (R): Legal / Dev
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per component</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3247_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3247_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3247_Task8" name="Security (links to VS-27.3) track open-source vulnerabilities (CVEs) in…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Security (links to VS-27.3) track open-source vulnerabilities (CVEs) in components, remediate via patch/upgrade (links to W3250), monitor for new advisories; integrate SCA (software composition analysis) into CI/CD (links to VS-27.1 W132); report license/security posture
Responsible (R): Security / Dev
Accountable (A): Software Asset Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3247_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3247_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3247_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3247_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
