        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-527 (ensure controlled execution — Software Asset Management &amp; License Compliance (PA-99.2).) | - operational: license review and architectural isolation; operational: SCA and patching (W3250)
Owner: Software Asset Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
