    <bpmn:process id="W_W3248" name="W3248. License Forecasting &amp; Software Budget Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual budget cycle (links to VS-33); forecasting refresh
Frequency: Annual + quarterly forecast update
Volume: Full software/cloud estate
Owner: Software Asset Manager
Participants: Software Asset Mgr, Finance (links to VS-17.4/VS-33), Procurement, IT, User Depts
Source: workflow W3248 — License Forecasting &amp; Software Budget Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3248_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3248_Lane1" name="Software Asset Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3248_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3248_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3248_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3248_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3248_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3248_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3248_Start4" name="Annual budget cycle (links to VS-33); forecasting refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3248_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3248_Task5" name="Software Asset Mgr/Finance build software spend forecast: current run-rate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Software Asset Mgr/Finance build software spend forecast: current run-rate (subscriptions, cloud, maintenance), planned growth (new stores VS-37, new capability VS-30), refresh (W3238), known renewals/true-ups (W3245), inflation/price-change; scenario analysis
Responsible (R): Software Asset Mgr / Finance
Accountable (A): Software Asset Manager
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3248_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3248_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3248_Task6" name="Finance (links to VS-33/VS-17.4) integrate into IT budget and group capex/opex…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance (links to VS-33/VS-17.4) integrate into IT budget and group capex/opex split (capitalize perpetual, expense subscription/SaaS/cloud); allocate to entities (links to VS-72); obtain approval per authority (links to VS-40/VS-36)
Responsible (R): Finance / IT
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3248_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3248_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3248_Task7" name="Track actual vs budget monthly (links to VS-17.4), update rolling forecast…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Track actual vs budget monthly (links to VS-17.4), update rolling forecast quarterly, flag variances for action (W3242/W3244 optimization); report KPIs (software spend per employee, per store, % of IT budget)
Responsible (R): Software Asset Mgr / Finance
Accountable (A): Software Asset Manager
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3248_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3248_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3248_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3248_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3248_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-527 (ensure controlled execution — Software Asset Management &amp; License Compliance (PA-99.2).) | - operational: FinOps telemetry and rolling forecast; operational: clear accounting policy
Owner: Software Asset Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
